  "findings": [
    "Separated traditional/enhanced/OTel ContainerInsights naming, dimensions, billing and platform requirements; removed nonexistent cluster_cpu_utilization/cluster_memory_utilization, corrected node/pod network rates and node-versus-pod-limit denominators.",
    "Replaced obsolete add-on pin and false eksctl control-plane-logging activation with actual version/architecture/compute compatibility discovery and a pinned Helm6.6.0 LinuxEC2 example. Agent image1.300072.0b1766 retained separately from GitHub agentv1.300071.0.",
    "Corrected Kubernetes agent JSON to logs.metrics_collected; removed invalid duplicate metrics-root collector and JSONcomments. Replaced incomplete manually mounted/RBAC-less DaemonSet with reviewed chart ownership and explicit custom-collector prerequisites.",
    "Verified chartagent/FluentBit serviceAccount cloudwatch-agent; roleArn is not an EKSIRSAshortcut. Documented PodIdentity/IRSA prerequisites, runtime identity versus localSTS, and Windows/Fargate/AutoMode limits.",
    "Native Helm revealed2Windows-specificCRs even in Linuxexample and despite LinuxApplicationSignalsdisabled; documented mixed-cluster review requirement. Traditionalrender3agentCRs/dualmetrics4, including1/2Linuxagents respectively.",
    "Preserved April2preview and July6ServiceEvents actual dates, separated historicallaunchregions fromcurrentavailability; OTel offbydefault, minimum6.2+ notcurrentcompatibilitymatrix, optionaldualmetrics and explicitlogcollectionownership avoidduplicateingestion.",
    "Repaired Prometheus namedport/namespace selection and explicitClusterName/Namespace/Servicelabelvalues; separategaugeexample avoidsfalsecounter/histogram semantics. ADOTv0.50 componentconfig sourceverified withscopedpoddiscoveryRBAC andsinglecollectionowner prerequisites.",
